    "detailed_description": "Step into Astera, a steampunk-infused fantasy world. Play your way in this fast-paced Action RPG featuring dual class specialization, rogue-like dungeons, a vast open world to explore and co-operative multiplayer. Crafted with passion by a dedicated team of action RPG enthusiasts.<br><br>In the world of Astera, a forgotten cataclysm has left its mark. You play as an agent of the Eternal Watchers, a secretive organization dedicated to protecting the realm since the dawn of a new civilization. Arm yourself with powerful weapons and abilities as you defend Astera from forces that could forever change the planet as you know it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fast Paced and Fluid Combat</strong></li></ul>Engage in visceral, fast-paced combat where every move counts. Master abilities designed for maximum satisfaction and tactical depth. Unleash devastating combos against relentless hordes of enemies. Experience a unique challenge with adaptive smarter enemies, not just tougher ones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/ff8775c212c5ef3e0ea8044b9cab2b36.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/ff8775c212c5ef3e0ea8044b9cab2b36.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/ff8775c212c5ef3e0ea8044b9cab2b36.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dual Class Specialization</strong></li></ul>Unleash your fantasy by combining talents and abilities from two hero classes. You start with a primary hero class and will be able to pick a secondary hero class later, enabling powerful combinations. You can start as a steel-clad warrior and become a paladin by picking  up a cleric class as a secondary specialization. Or specialize in blasting your enemies from afar by combining a ranger and a mage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/6a01935d85d09289638bbcdf738c9e0b.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/6a01935d85d09289638bbcdf738c9e0b.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/6a01935d85d09289638bbcdf738c9e0b.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Endless Character Customization</strong></li></ul>Customize your hero with a vast array of unique items that unlock powerful synergies. Discover unique equipment in dungeons, enabling you to craft your ideal build without relying on luck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/7fc216cf6ba37178d0fceb14d57631ad.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/7fc216cf6ba37178d0fceb14d57631ad.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/7fc216cf6ba37178d0fceb14d57631ad.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dungeons Featuring Rogue-like Gameplay</strong></li></ul>Dive into procedurally generated dungeons that offer a fresh rogue-like experience every time. Choose new powers as you progress, transforming your hero and playstyle with each run. Each dungeon crawl is a unique, engaging challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/5a74304dde618fe54753e5b3907400e6.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/5a74304dde618fe54753e5b3907400e6.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/5a74304dde618fe54753e5b3907400e6.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Meaningful Cooperative Multiplayer</strong></li></ul>Team up with friends to tackle challenging content together. Use support abilities to aid your allies or shield them with defensive skills. Enjoy a fully accessible solo experience as well\u2014multiplayer is optional, but the camaraderie is unparalleled.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/fde48a245c24453de7bba27aa1a162e3.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/fde48a245c24453de7bba27aa1a162e3.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/fde48a245c24453de7bba27aa1a162e3.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore a Vast World</strong></li></ul>Embark on an adventure in a meticulously crafted open world, brimming with secrets and rewards for the curious explorer. Immerse into the rich lore and soak in the atmospheric beauty of Astera.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/0f39ac38c2ca3bc591eb448419f10c30.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Step into Astera, a steampunk-infused fantasy world. Play your way in this fast-paced Action RPG featuring dual class specialization, rogue-like dungeons, a vast open world to explore and co-operative multiplayer. Crafted with passion by a dedicated team of action RPG enthusiasts.<br><br>In the world of Astera, a forgotten cataclysm has left its mark. You play as an agent of the Eternal Watchers, a secretive organization dedicated to protecting the realm since the dawn of a new civilization. Arm yourself with powerful weapons and abilities as you defend Astera from forces that could forever change the planet as you know it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fast Paced and Fluid Combat</strong></li></ul>Engage in visceral, fast-paced combat where every move counts. Master abilities designed for maximum satisfaction and tactical depth. Unleash devastating combos against relentless hordes of enemies. Experience a unique challenge with adaptive smarter enemies, not just tougher ones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/ff8775c212c5ef3e0ea8044b9cab2b36.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/ff8775c212c5ef3e0ea8044b9cab2b36.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/ff8775c212c5ef3e0ea8044b9cab2b36.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dual Class Specialization</strong></li></ul>Unleash your fantasy by combining talents and abilities from two hero classes. You start with a primary hero class and will be able to pick a secondary hero class later, enabling powerful combinations. You can start as a steel-clad warrior and become a paladin by picking  up a cleric class as a secondary specialization. Or specialize in blasting your enemies from afar by combining a ranger and a mage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/6a01935d85d09289638bbcdf738c9e0b.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/6a01935d85d09289638bbcdf738c9e0b.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/6a01935d85d09289638bbcdf738c9e0b.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Endless Character Customization</strong></li></ul>Customize your hero with a vast array of unique items that unlock powerful synergies. Discover unique equipment in dungeons, enabling you to craft your ideal build without relying on luck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/7fc216cf6ba37178d0fceb14d57631ad.poster.avif?t=1739736538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/7fc216cf6ba37178d0fceb14d57631ad.webm?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866330/extras/7fc216cf6ba37178d0fceb14d57631ad.mp4?t=1739736538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dungeons Featuring Rogue-like Gameplay</strong></li></ul>Dive into procedurally generated dungeons that offer a fresh rogue-like experience every time. Choose new powers as you progress, transforming your hero and playstyle with each run. Each dungeon crawl is